WEBVTT

00:40:59.954 --> 00:41:01.621
there's nothing they can do about it.

00:41:02.288 --> 00:41:06.163
And so, yes, we have compromised their
future. We've been stealing it.

00:41:06.163 --> 00:41:08.079
We're still stealing it today, actually.

00:41:08.329 --> 00:41:11.871
But I believe firmly that we
have a window of time.

00:41:12.329 --> 00:41:19.038
And if we get together and put our
brains together, that we can

00:41:20.663 --> 00:41:24.746
at least heal some of the harm that we've
inflicted and slow down climate change.

00:41:25.121 --> 00:41:29.079
But we've got to do it now. And that's why
I was travelling all over the place.

00:41:29.079 --> 00:41:33.829
And that's why I'm trying to create this
virtual Jane who actually reaches far